"P3674034962" "So that Freakshow boss who goes by Eddie Crush has went and fled to the mainland, eh? Typical landlubber! Arrr, he probably was followin' up on whoever he thinks is the leader of them Scrapyarders! That's a powerful piece of information, means lots of money to whoever gets it!<br><br>We can't be letting this Eddie Crush be gettin' the prize here! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to Paragon City and take down the Freakshow boss</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P1059484733" "Take down Freakshow boss in Paragon City"
// SendOffString :
"P1063962147" "Give those Freakshow a good beatin'!"
