// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2513745545" "I've got some bad news for ya, {VillainName}! You know how those Council lubbers were also lookin' for the Scrapyarder boss? Well, they've gotten more success from their interrogations, finding out the Scrapyarder leader is a woman called Iron Widow, Scrapyard's widow! What's more, they've got the Scrapyarder leader in the base on Sharkhead! It sounds like Marshall Brass is coming with a large Arachnos force from Villa Requin to incarcerate the Scrapyarder leader.<br><br>We need to move quickly! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Break into the Council base and kidnap Iron Widow</A>.<br><br>You have 90 minutes to complete this mission, and Iron Widow must survive!"
// AcceptString :
"P3251089589" "Kidnap Iron Widow from Council base"
// SendOffString :
"P2462217789" "Arrr! This be our last chance, {VillainName}! I'll have some of me boys ready to grab her when you get her out of the Council base.<br><br>The Council base is fairly well-protected. You'd best be move in there quietly, or bring a small army with you!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1441971613" "Get goin' ya lubber! Ya got a whale tied to yer behind or somethin'? Get Iron Widow!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3698366755" "Klaxxon horns announce your presence to the Council troops within. You're expected!"
