// Dialog :
"P662819330" "Marshal Brass arrived with his Arachnos troops. Iron Widow is captured, but you manage to escape."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2147577333" "Arrr, {VillainName}! You did a fine job in getting' Iron Widow out of that Council base. Me boys got her clear of the base... and back to the mainland.<br><br>Yer probably wonderin' why the devil a filthy old sea dog like myself would want to get Iron Widow to safety after all the work we did to find her, and the wealth to be had by sellin' her to Marshal Brass. Truth be told, I used to know the man known as Scrapyard back in the day, the fella who started the Scrapyarders and was murdered by Captain Mako. He was a proud man with a sense of honor, somethin' I never had with all the blood and thievin' in my life. I could have helped Scrapyard on the docks when he was murdered, but I figured then it was none of me business. His screams haunt me to this day. When I heard that the Scrapyarder leader was about to be caught, I knew I had to do somethin' to honor the memory of Scrapyard. And that's why I set Iron Widow free!<br><br>This one act may never redeem me for my lifetime of treachery, but I did what I needed to do. You may want to send me to Davy Jones' locker for deceivin' ya, {VillainName}. I know I've slit men's throats for less. But I'm not quite done with this life yet, so I'll bargain with ya for me life. I ain't got much, but take this - it's Scrapyard's wedding ring; it's all that was left of him after Mako got through with him."
// RandomFameString :
"P590928461" "{VillainName} snatched out Iron Widow right from under Marshal Brass' nose!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3463921078" "Arrr! You couldn't get her out in time? 'Tis par for course for Petrovich it seems. Y'see my intent was to grab the lady and send her to back to the mainland.<br><br>Yer probably wonderin' why the devil a filthy old sea dog like myself would want to get Iron Widow to safety after all the work we did to find her, and the wealth to be had by sellin' her to Marshal Brass. Truth be told, I used to know the man known as Scrapyard back in the day, the fella who started the Scrapyarders and was murdered by Captain Mako. He was a proud man with a sense of honor, somethin' I never had with all the blood and thievin' in my life. I could have helped Scrapyard on the docks when he was murdered, but I figured then it was none of me business. His screams haunt me to this day. When I heard that the Scrapyarder leader was about to be caught, I knew I had to do somethin' to honor the memory of Scrapyard. And that's why I set Iron Widow free!<br><br>This one act may never redeem me for my lifetime of treachery, but I did what I needed to do. You may want to send me to Davy Jones' locker for deceivin' ya, {VillainName}. I know I've slit men's throats for less. But I'm not quite done with this life yet, so I'll bargain with ya for me life. I ain't got much, but take this - it's Scrapyard's wedding ring; it's all that was left of him after Mako got through with him. "
// RandomFameString :
"P199885840" "I hear that {VillainName} tried to kidnap Iron Widow from a Council base, but was stopped by Marshal Brass and his Arachnos troops."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P676560109" "{VillainName} kept the Scrapyarder leader on the run!"
